WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:05.405 line:0%
W

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:09.676 line:0%
CLEARLY MEANT TO SAY RIGHT TO

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:11.344 line:0%
LIFE, AND CALLS IT A MISHAP.

00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:12.579 line:0%
THERE'S A NEWS POLL OUT TODAY

00:00:11.578 --> 00:00:13.747 line:0%
IS SHOWING THAT NEARLY SIX AND

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:16.583 line:0%
TEN PEOPLE DISAPPROVE OF THE

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:18.518 line:0%
DECISION TO OVERTURN ROE V.

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:19.219 line:0%
WADE, AND THAT INCLUDES TWO

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:21.354 line:0%
THIRDS OF WOMEN SURVEYED.

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:22.655 line:0%
JOINING ME NOW IS REPUBLICAN

00:00:21.588 --> 00:00:23.023 line:0%
CONGRESSMAN WARREN DAVIDSON OF

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:24.524 line:0%
OHIO.

00:00:23.256 --> 00:00:24.991 line:0%
GOOD EVENING TO YOU,

00:00:24.758 --> 00:00:26.559 line:0%
CONGRESSMAN.

00:00:25.392 --> 00:00:28.728 line:0%
&gt;&gt; GOOD EVENING, PATTA.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:30.430 line:0%
&gt;&gt; LET'S TALK ABOUT OHIO.

00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:32.399 line:0%
YOUR STATES HEARTBEAT BILL,

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:33.366 line:0%
WHICH IS NOW IN EFFECT, IT BANS

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:36.436 line:0%
ABORTIONS ONCE A FETAL

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:37.170 line:0%
HEARTBEAT IS DETECTIVE, ROUGHLY

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:39.606 line:0%
SIX WEEKS INTO A PREGNANCY.

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:40.673 line:0%
THAT IS A TIME WHEN SOME PEOPLE

00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:41.107 line:0%
MIGHT NOT EVEN KNOW THEY'RE

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:42.575 line:0%
PREGNANT.

00:00:41.341 --> 00:00:43.576 line:0%
THERE IS NO EXCEPTION FOR RAPE

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:46.546 line:0%
OR INCEST.

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:47.380 line:0%
SO MY QUESTION IS, WHAT HAPPENS

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:48.681 line:0%
WHEN A 12-YEAR-OLD GIRL FALLS

00:00:47.614 --> 00:00:50.383 line:0%
PREGNANT AFTER BEING RAPED?

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:51.651 line:0%
ARE YOU OKAY WITH HER BEING

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:52.018 line:0%
FORCED TO CARRY THAT FETUS TO

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:55.622 line:0%
TERM?

00:00:53.353 --> 00:00:57.690 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WHILE, UNDER OHIO'S LAW, YOU

00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:59.759 line:0%
KNOW, IT DOESN'T BAN THINGS

00:00:57.924 --> 00:01:01.594 line:0%
LIKE A ABORTIONS.

00:01:00.427 --> 00:01:02.529 line:0%
SO LET'S SAY SOMEONE WAS RAPED,

00:01:01.828 --> 00:01:03.630 line:0%
YOU DON'T KNOW YOU ARE RAPED

00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:05.632 line:0%
FOR TWO MONTHS?

00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:06.766 line:0%
I THINK THAT IT'S INCORPORATED

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:08.668 line:0%
IN TO DEAL WITH THAT.

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:11.571 line:0%
THAT IS A COMPROMISE.

00:01:09.202 --> 00:01:14.374 line:0%
PEOPLE BELIEVE THAT LIFE BEGINS

00:01:12.372 --> 00:01:14.874 line:0%
AT CONCEPTION, THAT'S WITH THE

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:15.175 line:0%
SCIENCE SAYS.

00:01:15.108 --> 00:01:17.510 line:0%
--

00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:18.545 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WELL, THE SCIENCE IS NOT

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:21.514 line:0%
CONCLUSIVE ON THAT.

00:01:18.778 --> 00:01:22.649 line:0%
THERE IS NO CONSENSUS ON LIFE

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:24.551 line:0%
BEGINNING AT CONCEPTION.

00:01:23.383 --> 00:01:26.486 line:0%
BUT I KNOW THAT THAT IS

00:01:24.784 --> 00:01:27.420 line:0%
CERTAINLY SOMETHING THAT YOU

00:01:26.719 --> 00:01:28.588 line:0%
BELIEVE, AND OTHER

00:01:27.654 --> 00:01:30.390 line:0%
CONSERVATIVES BELIEVE.

00:01:29.389 --> 00:01:32.358 line:0%
BUT I JUST WANT TO ASK YOU

00:01:30.623 --> 00:01:33.593 line:0%
AGAIN, BECAUSE THIS OBVIOUSLY

00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:34.761 line:0%
RAISES SOME TOUGH QUESTIONS.

00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:38.364 line:0%
OF COURSE, RIGHT?

00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:39.499 line:0%
WHAT HAPPENS OF A 12-YEAR-OLD

00:01:38.598 --> 00:01:40.767 line:0%
GETS RAPED?

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:42.569 line:0%
ARE YOU COMFORTABLE WITH HER

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:44.370 line:0%
HAVING TO NOW CARRY THAT BABY

00:01:42.802 --> 00:01:46.539 line:0%
TO TERM BECAUSE THERE IS NO

00:01:44.604 --> 00:01:47.607 line:0%
EXCEPTION FOR HER CASE?

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:50.577 line:0%
UNDER OHIO LAW?

00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:54.514 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I FULLY SUPPORT OHIO'S LAW

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:55.682 line:0%
AND I COMMEND OUR, FRANKLY, OUR

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:58.418 line:0%
GOVERNOR AND OUR LEGISLATURE

00:01:56.149 --> 00:01:59.152 line:0%
FOR PASSING IT, WERE PREVIOUS

00:01:58.651 --> 00:02:01.554 line:0%
ADMINISTRATIONS HAD FAILED.

00:01:59.385 --> 00:02:05.525 line:0%
THEY PASSED IT, IT WAS HELD UP

00:02:01.788 --> 00:02:06.559 line:0%
BY THE COURTS, AND RELIEF FROM

00:02:05.758 --> 00:02:07.594 line:0%
THE INJUNCTION WAS FILED

00:02:06.793 --> 00:02:09.529 line:0%
IMMEDIATELY ON FRIDAY.

00:02:07.827 --> 00:02:11.531 line:0%
IT IS NOW THE LAW IN OHIO.

00:02:09.762 --> 00:02:12.665 line:0%
I THINK IT'S A GREAT LAW, AND

00:02:11.764 --> 00:02:15.568 line:0%
IT IS A COMPROMISE.

00:02:13.366 --> 00:02:17.370 line:0%
AND LIKE I SAID, RAPE IS RAISED

00:02:15.802 --> 00:02:18.705 line:0%
AS AN OBJECTION, BUT THE

00:02:17.604 --> 00:02:19.139 line:0%
HEARTBEAT BILL ALREADY DEALS

00:02:18.938 --> 00:02:21.407 line:0%
WITH THAT.

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:22.509 line:0%
IT'S HARD TO CONCEIVE OF

00:02:21.641 --> 00:02:23.643 line:0%
SOMEBODY WHO DOESN'T KNOW THEY

00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:27.380 line:0%
WERE RAPED FOR TWO MONTHS.

00:02:24.377 --> 00:02:28.148 line:0%
&gt;&gt; LOOK, I'M NOT GONNA PUT

00:02:27.614 --> 00:02:28.915 line:0%
MYSELF IN THE SHOES OF SOMEONE

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:29.649 line:0%
WHO IS RAPED, BUT I'M SURE IF

00:02:29.149 --> 00:02:31.551 line:0%
THEY WERE HERE TO SPEAK WITH

00:02:29.883 --> 00:02:33.520 line:0%
YOU, THEY WOULD BE PUSHING BACK

00:02:31.784 --> 00:02:34.787 line:0%
ON THAT NOTION, BUT THERE'S ALL

00:02:33.753 --> 00:02:36.456 line:0%
KINDS OF TRAUMATIC EXPERIENCES

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:38.525 line:0%
THAT WOULD HAPPEN AFTER SUCH A

00:02:36.689 --> 00:02:40.360 line:0%
THING, AND IN THE PROCESSING OF

00:02:38.758 --> 00:02:41.594 line:0%
IT, AND THEN FINDING OUT YOUR

00:02:40.593 --> 00:02:42.695 line:0%
PREGNANT, AND SO FORTH.

00:02:41.828 --> 00:02:43.763 line:0%
THERE'S A LOT OF COMPLEXITIES.

00:02:42.929 --> 00:02:45.598 line:0%
I WANT TO ASK YOU ABOUT OHIO

00:02:43.997 --> 00:02:46.633 line:0%
WHEN IT COMES TO ITS RANKINGS

00:02:45.832 --> 00:02:48.601 line:0%
IN TERMS OF INFANT MORTALITY.

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:50.603 line:0%
IT'S NEAR THE MIDDLE FOR

00:02:48.835 --> 00:02:52.605 line:0%
MATERNAL MORTALITY, IT'S RANKED

00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:54.707 line:0%
41ST IN INFANT MORTALITY.

00:02:54.207 --> 00:02:55.441 line:0%
AFRICAN AMERICANS ARE

00:02:54.941 --> 00:02:56.576 line:0%
DISPROPORTIONATELY IMPACTED,

00:02:55.675 --> 00:02:57.744 line:0%
AND WITH THIS BAN IN PLACE,

00:02:56.809 --> 00:02:58.745 line:0%
THAT RATE OF INFANT MORTALITY

00:02:57.977 --> 00:03:02.415 line:0%
WILL LIKELY GO UP.

00:03:00.246 --> 00:03:05.385 line:0%
SO, WHAT ARE YOU GOING TO DO TO

00:03:02.649 --> 00:03:06.486 line:0%
COMBAT THAT AND PROTECT THESE

00:03:05.618 --> 00:03:08.354 line:0%
DISADVANTAGED WOMEN AND

00:03:06.719 --> 00:03:09.489 line:0%
CHILDREN WHO ARE DIRECTLY

00:03:08.588 --> 00:03:13.726 line:0%
IMPACTED BY THIS ABORTION BAN?

00:03:10.356 --> 00:03:15.662 line:0%
&gt;&gt; LOOK, OHIO, UNFORTUNATELY,

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:18.364 line:0%
WE HAVE OVER HALF OF THE LIVE

00:03:15.895 --> 00:03:18.798 line:0%
BIRTHS AND OHIO ARE ON

00:03:18.598 --> 00:03:21.801 line:0%
MEDICAID.

00:03:19.365 --> 00:03:23.403 line:0%
SO WE HAVE A DISPROPORTIONATE

00:03:22.035 --> 00:03:25.338 line:0%
AMOUNT OF OUR FAMILIES THAT ARE

00:03:23.636 --> 00:03:25.772 line:0%
GROWING OUR LOW INCOME

00:03:25.572 --> 00:03:27.707 line:0%
FAMILIES.

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:31.544 line:0%
I THINK THAT OVERWHELMINGLY

00:03:27.941 --> 00:03:33.646 line:0%
ACCOUNTS FOR THE LOSS OF LIFE

00:03:32.378 --> 00:03:34.581 line:0%
IN LABOR AND DELIVERY.

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:37.383 line:0%
SO I THINK WE HAVE TO LOOK AT,

00:03:34.814 --> 00:03:39.586 line:0%
HOW DO WE STRENGTHEN THAT,

00:03:37.617 --> 00:03:41.354 line:0%
EARLY TREATMENT OF ANYTHING

00:03:39.819 --> 00:03:43.756 line:0%
THAT GOES WRONG IN THE

00:03:41.588 --> 00:03:46.659 line:0%
PREGNANCY IS ALWAYS IMPORTANT.

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:47.627 line:0%
I THINK CONSISTENT PRENATAL

00:03:46.893 --> 00:03:49.395 line:0%
CARE THROUGH THAT PROCESS --

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:50.563 line:0%
YOU, KNOW MY WIFE AND I HAD OUR

00:03:49.629 --> 00:03:52.365 line:0%
KIDS WHEN WE WERE IN THE ARMY,

00:03:51.231 --> 00:03:53.533 line:0%
AND THAT WAS GOVERNMENT

00:03:52.599 --> 00:03:55.368 line:0%
OPERATED HEALTH CARE.

00:03:53.766 --> 00:03:58.371 line:0%
I WOULD HOPE THAT THE FEDERALLY

00:03:55.602 --> 00:03:59.405 line:0%
QUALIFIED HEALTH CARE

00:03:58.605 --> 00:04:00.607 line:0%
PROFESSIONALS WOULD AT LEAST

00:03:59.639 --> 00:04:03.343 line:0%
MEET THAT STANDARD, AND WHERE

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:05.612 line:0%
THEY FALL SHORT, OUR OFFICE IS

00:04:03.576 --> 00:04:06.079 line:0%
OPEN FOR CASEWORK TO TRY TO

00:04:05.845 --> 00:04:07.547 line:0%
SUPPORT IT.

00:04:06.379 --> 00:04:11.651 line:0%
WE HAVEN'T HAD ANY.

00:04:09.349 --> 00:04:13.386 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I KNOW THAT THIS IS AN ISSUE

00:04:11.884 --> 00:04:15.588 line:0%
THAT GETS A LOT OF PEOPLE

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:16.723 line:0%
WORKED UP, BUT I THINK WET --

00:04:15.822 --> 00:04:19.325 line:0%
THERE IS A LOT OF CONCERN RIGHT

00:04:16.956 --> 00:04:20.627 line:0%
NOW THAT SO MANY STATES,

00:04:19.559 --> 00:04:21.561 line:0%
INCLUDING OHIO, HAVE THESE

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:23.363 line:0%
ABORTION BANS.

00:04:22.161 --> 00:04:24.597 line:0%
AND THERE'S BEEN THIS FIGHT FOR

00:04:23.596 --> 00:04:27.367 line:0%
A BABY IN THE WOMB, BUT WHAT

00:04:24.831 --> 00:04:28.034 line:0%
ABOUT THE FIGHT FOR THE CHILD

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:29.569 line:0%
AFTER IT LEAVES THE WIN?

00:04:28.401 --> 00:04:31.371 line:0%
THE DISADVANTAGED MOTHER?

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:31.938 line:0%
ARE YOU GONNA COMMIT TO

00:04:31.604 --> 00:04:34.540 line:0%
FIGHTING FOR THEM?

00:04:32.372 --> 00:04:36.643 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I ALREADY DO FIGHT FOR THEM,

00:04:35.174 --> 00:04:38.344 line:0%
AND FRANKLY, LOOK, AS SOMEBODY

00:04:37.176 --> 00:04:39.646 line:0%
WHO BELIEVES THAT LIFE BEGINS

00:04:38.578 --> 00:04:41.514 line:0%
AT CONCEPTION, WE WANT EVERY

00:04:39.879 --> 00:04:43.349 line:0%
BABY TO BE A HEALTHY BABY, AND

00:04:41.748 --> 00:04:44.651 line:0%
WE KNOW THAT SOME BABIES ARE

00:04:43.583 --> 00:04:46.753 line:0%
CHALLENGED FROM BIRTH.

00:04:45.418 --> 00:04:49.656 line:0%
I WAS AT CHURCH THIS MORNING

00:04:46.986 --> 00:04:54.527 line:0%
WITH SOMEONE WHO IS PROVIDING

00:04:49.889 --> 00:04:57.430 line:0%
FOSTER CARE FOR A PRENATAL --

00:04:55.194 --> 00:04:59.565 line:0%
HAS BABIES OUT JUST NOW AT FULL

00:04:57.664 --> 00:05:02.568 line:0%
TERM, AND HAS SPENT THE FIRST

00:04:59.799 --> 00:05:05.738 line:0%
NEARLY TWO MONTHS IN NICK YOU

00:05:02.802 --> 00:05:07.607 line:0%
TO TRY TO GET STABLE.

00:05:06.372 --> 00:05:09.509 line:0%
&gt;&gt; THERE'S ALL KINDS OF STORIES

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:10.410 line:0%
HERE, THE BOTTOM LINE IS HE SAY

00:05:09.742 --> 00:05:11.711 line:0%
YOU'RE FIGHTING, BUT THERE ARE

00:05:10.643 --> 00:05:12.679 line:0%
60,000 KIDS IN OHIO THAT HAVE

00:05:11.944 --> 00:05:15.615 line:0%
BEEN TAKEN AWAY --

00:05:13.446 --> 00:05:15.982 line:0%
I THINK IT'S 9000 IN FOSTER

00:05:15.848 --> 00:05:18.618 line:0%
CARE.

00:05:16.215 --> 00:05:19.385 line:0%
THERE'S CONCERN THAT THAT

00:05:18.851 --> 00:05:20.353 line:0%
SYSTEM IS GONNA BE OVERLOADED,

00:05:19.619 --> 00:05:21.054 line:0%
AND WHAT'S GONNA BE DONE TO

00:05:20.586 --> 00:05:23.556 line:0%
HELP THEM WITH RESOURCES?

00:05:21.421 --> 00:05:24.624 line:0%
I WANT TO ASK YOU ABOUT FORMER

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:25.658 line:0%
VICE PRESIDENT MIKE PENCE, HE

00:05:24.857 --> 00:05:27.393 line:0%
IS CALLING FOR A NATIONAL

00:05:25.892 --> 00:05:28.494 line:0%
ABORTION BAN, HOUSE LEADERS ARE

00:05:27.627 --> 00:05:29.629 line:0%
CALLING FOR A NATIONAL BAN

00:05:28.728 --> 00:05:32.365 line:0%
AFTER 15 WEEKS --

00:05:29.862 --> 00:05:32.899 line:0%
DO YOU SUPPORT A NATIONAL,

00:05:32.598 --> 00:05:35.368 line:0%
NATIONWIDE BAN?

00:05:33.366 --> 00:05:36.602 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I BELIEVE LIFE BEGINS AT

00:05:35.601 --> 00:05:39.339 line:0%
CONCEPTION, AND I UNDERSTAND

00:05:36.836 --> 00:05:40.473 line:0%
THAT WE HAVE PEOPLE WHO

00:05:39.572 --> 00:05:42.608 line:0%
PASSIONATELY DISAGREE.

00:05:41.407 --> 00:05:44.711 line:0%
IF YOU LOOK AT WHERE DEMOCRATS

00:05:42.842 --> 00:05:45.745 line:0%
WERE ON THIS ISSUE, WHY WAS

00:05:44.944 --> 00:05:46.112 line:0%
THIS CASE BEFORE THE SUPREME

00:05:45.978 --> 00:05:47.747 line:0%
COURT?

00:05:46.346 --> 00:05:49.716 line:0%
THEY WERE UNWILLING FOR

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:50.616 line:0%
MISSISSIPPI TO LIMIT ABORTION

00:05:50.383 --> 00:05:52.752 line:0%
TO 15 WEEKS.

00:05:51.351 --> 00:05:55.355 line:0%
NOT ONLY THAT, HOUSE DEMOCRATS

00:05:52.985 --> 00:05:56.656 line:0%
PUT ON THE FLOOR THAT OPPOSED

00:05:55.588 --> 00:05:57.657 line:0%
EVERY SINGLE MEMBER OF THE

00:05:56.889 --> 00:06:00.526 line:0%
HOUSE DEMOCRATIC CONFERENCE --

00:05:59.192 --> 00:06:02.362 line:0%
OPPOSED THE PROTECTION ACT.

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:02.795 line:0%
THESE BABIES HAVE ALREADY BEEN

00:06:02.595 --> 00:06:05.565 line:0%
DELIVERED.

00:06:03.029 --> 00:06:05.998 line:0%
THEY STILL WON ONE OF PROTECT

00:06:05.798 --> 00:06:09.669 line:0%
THAT LIFE.

00:06:06.232 --> 00:06:11.471 line:0%
THEY SUPPORTED GOVERNOR NOR

00:06:09.902 --> 00:06:14.374 line:0%
TERMS DECISION THAT --

00:06:12.171 --> 00:06:14.841 line:0%
THAT'S NOT ABORTION, THAT'S

00:06:14.607 --> 00:06:17.410 line:0%
INFANTICIDE.

00:06:15.408 --> 00:06:19.545 line:0%
&gt;&gt; JUST TO BE CLEAR, DO YOU

00:06:17.643 --> 00:06:19.979 line:0%
SUPPORT A NATIONWIDE BAN ON

00:06:19.779 --> 00:06:22.348 line:0%
ABORTION?

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:22.915 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I SUPPORT LIFE AT CONCEPTION

00:06:22.582 --> 00:06:24.650 line:0%
ACT IN THE HOUSE.

00:06:24.183 --> 00:06:28.488 line:0%
I'M A COSPONSOR.

00:06:26.185 --> 00:06:30.423 line:0%
AND OHIO, I THINK OHIO'S OUR --

00:06:28.721 --> 00:06:32.392 line:0%
HEARTBEAT BILL IS A REASONABLE

00:06:30.656 --> 00:06:33.626 line:0%
POSITION OF COMPROMISE, AND I

00:06:32.625 --> 00:06:35.561 line:0%
WOULD LOVE TO SEE STATES ACROSS

00:06:33.860 --> 00:06:38.364 line:0%
THE COUNTRY GET THEIR, NOT BY

00:06:35.795 --> 00:06:40.500 line:0%
FORCE, JUST BY MORAL CONSENSUS,

00:06:38.598 --> 00:06:40.933 line:0%
THAT THIS IS A LIFE AND IT IS

00:06:40.733 --> 00:06:42.668 line:0%
PRECIOUS.

00:06:41.401 --> 00:06:44.604 line:0%
IT SHOULD BE PROTECTED.

00:06:43.403 --> 00:06:45.671 line:0%
AND IF A MOTHER SAYS, YOU KNOW,

00:06:44.837 --> 00:06:48.408 line:0%
I DON'T THINK I CAN RAISE THIS

00:06:45.905 --> 00:06:49.342 line:0%
BABY, THERE ARE MILLIONS OF

00:06:48.641 --> 00:06:49.876 line:0%
AMERICANS WHO WOULD LOVE TO

00:06:49.575 --> 00:06:52.412 line:0%
ADOPT THAT BABY.

00:06:51.144 --> 00:06:54.380 line:0%
AND HOPEFULLY, WE CAN MAKE

00:06:52.645 --> 00:06:56.516 line:0%
ADOPTION AND FOSTER CARE A MORE

00:06:54.614 --> 00:06:58.518 line:0%
VIABLE OPTION FOR EVERYONE --

00:06:57.383 --> 00:06:59.619 line:0%
&gt;&gt; UNFORTUNATELY, THE FOSTER

00:06:58.751 --> 00:07:00.553 line:0%
CARE SYSTEM IS SO INCREDIBLY

00:06:59.852 --> 00:07:01.788 line:0%
BROKEN, THOUGH.

00:07:00.787 --> 00:07:02.155 line:0%
WE'VE DONE STORY AFTER STORY ON

00:07:02.021 --> 00:07:03.389 line:0%
THAT.

00:07:02.388 --> 00:07:04.524 line:0%
BUT WHEN IT SOUNDS LIKE YOU'RE

00:07:03.623 --> 00:07:06.359 line:0%
SAYING IS, YOU WOULD LIKE OTHER

00:07:04.757 --> 00:07:08.461 line:0%
STATES TO ADOPT A BILL LIKE

00:07:06.592 --> 00:07:10.530 line:0%
OHIO HAS, BUT YOU ARE NOT FOR A

00:07:08.694 --> 00:07:11.597 line:0%
FEDERAL LAW MANDATING EVERY

00:07:10.763 --> 00:07:13.399 line:0%
STATE HAVE ABORTION.

00:07:11.831 --> 00:07:14.567 line:0%
CORRECT ME IF I'M WRONG BEFORE

00:07:13.633 --> 00:07:15.701 line:0%
WE MOVE ON, BECAUSE WE DO HAVE

00:07:14.801 --> 00:07:17.737 line:0%
OTHER TOPICS WE NEED TO GET TO.

